@startuml
actor User
participant "API Service" as API
participant "Command Handler" as CH
participant "State Manager" as SM
participant "Device Adapter" as DA
participant "Heating Device" as HD

User -> API: POST /heating/{deviceId}/on
API -> CH: validate & build Command
CH -> SM: save pending command
CH -> DA: send command
DA -> HD: HTTP PUT /relay/on
HD --> DA: 200 OK / status
DA --> CH: delivery result
CH -> SM: update state (ON)
CH --> API: success JSON
API --> User: 200 OK
@enduml 